Node ID=13 Who is Menoetius
Text=Menoetius, my brother, is a very clever titan. When we failed to find what we were looking for here, we started searching farther afield. He soon happened upon a cave and found inside a strange being wrapped in a chrysalis. This being, which called itself Nostradamus, claimed it could see all things across all time.
Should Have Voiceover=0

