Text=Coming back. On his own feet. <The titan is quiet for a while.> Then he is still Memnos, and the tribe will hear him, and what we decide after that is ours to decide and not yours. You have done a strange thing today, fleshling, and I do not know yet whether it was a kindness. Take what we promised you and go.
