Node ID=500 Quest completed
Text=The Mneme! Excellent! Hehe, this Nostrodamus is quite a seer and you, fleshling, are a mighty runt to bring down so powerful a foe. 
Should Have Voiceover=0
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=501 Completed 2
Text=Here is your reward, fleshling. You can have the town, too, for all I care. Now that we have this we shall return to our mountains. Goodbye, fleshling, and hope, for your own sake, that we never meet again!
Should Have Voiceover=0
